  "notes": "FORMS:\n{融|ゆう} (dissolve, melt) + {解|かい} (dissolve, undo) → melting/dissolving\n{融解|ゆうかい}⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧ (to melt, to fuse)\n\nSCIENTIFIC TERMS:\n- {融解|ゆうかい}⟦{点|てん}→点：01553_ten⟧ (melting point)\n- {融解|ゆうかい}{熱|ねつ} (heat of fusion)\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- ⟦{溶解|ようかい}→溶解：17585_youkai⟧ (dissolution - dissolving in a liquid)\n- ⟦{凝固|ぎょうこ}→凝固：08668_gyouko⟧ (solidification - antonym)\n- ⟦{蒸発|じょうはつ}→蒸発：07651_jouhatsu⟧ (evaporation)\n- ⟦{凝縮|ぎょうしゅく}→凝縮：17584_gyoushuku⟧ (condensation)\n\nUSAGE:\n{融解|ゆうかい} refers specifically to the phase change from solid to liquid, while ⟦{溶解|ようかい}→溶解：17585_youkai⟧ refers to dissolving a substance in a solvent.",
